special edition structures:
	TheWorks
		maps from integers to Works 
		associates works with frontend structures (Drafts, Windows, etc.)
	the application HomeDoc
		connected by a homeDoc link to the login club
	the public HomeDoc
		connected by a homeDoc link to the public club
		Structure:
			"HomeDoc:linkTypes" -> linkTypes doc
			"HomeDoc:docTypes" -> contentTypes document
			"HomeDoc:homeDocWork" -> the normal homeDoc for the publicClub
	managing contentTypes
		contentTypes document structure: (TheDocTypes)
			Sequence(ContentTypeName) -> Work(ContentTypeName)
			the ID of the Work is the endorsement for that docType
		TheContentTypeMapping
			a session level mapping from endorsements to contentType numbers
			the domain regions are projections of the ContentType IDs
			the range positions are session level contentType numbers
			this extends to using special contentTypes depending on who made the endorsement
	TitleManager
	linkTypes
	SheetTypes
		right now ContentTypes are doubling for SheetTypes

